# .NET nullable and API shape

- New projects keep nullable reference types enabled. Entry points check null. Inside the boundary, trust the annotations.
- Compare with `is null` and `is not null`.
- Public APIs have XML docs when the repo already documents public surface.
- Follow `.editorconfig`: file-scoped namespaces, `nameof`, and pattern matching where the surrounding file does.
